<h1>Your New Verification Code</h1>
<p>Hello {{userName}},</p>
<p>We received a request for a new verification code for your {{companyName}} account. Enter the 6-digit code below to complete your email verification:</p>

<div class="otp-box">
  <span class="otp-code">{{otpCode}}</span>
  <span class="otp-timer">Expires in 10 minutes</span>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">
  <strong>Security Note:</strong> This code replaces any previous verification codes requested. Never share this code with anyone.
</p>
<p>If you did not request a new verification code, please ensure your account credentials are secure.</p>
